{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And you shall return.</b> You shall rest, as in בְּשׁוּבָה וָנַחַת (Isaiah 30:15) — this at the revelation of our righteous Messiah. And 'you shall stand in returning and rest' — He will not continue to exile you, as the prophet explained in saying: אִם תָּשׁוּב יִשְׂרָאֵל אֵלַי תָּשׁוּב וְלֹא תָנוּד (Jeremiah 4:1)." "<b>And you shall do all His commandments which I command you today.</b> So that you do not innovate a new religion."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:37.575384825Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}